{"title":"CentOS 7 安装中文输入法","slug":"CentOS7安装中文输入法","date":"2024-09-17T03:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-09-17T03:30:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/CentOS7安装中文输入法.json","excerpt":null,"covers":["https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/centos7.webp","https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/add_pinyin.webp","https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/change.webp"],"content":"<h1 id=\"第一步\"><a href=\"#第一步\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"第一步\"></a>第一步</h1><ul>\n<li>点击Application—&gt;System Tools—&gt;Settings，选择Region&amp;Language</li>\n<li><p>点击应用程序—&gt;系统工具—&gt;设置，选择Region&amp;Language<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/centos7.webp\"></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>点击 <code>&quot;+&quot;</code> 加号<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/add_pinyin.webp\"></p>\n</li>\n<li>切换输入法<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/change.webp\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"Intelligent-Pinyin拼音输入法安装\"><a href=\"#Intelligent-Pinyin拼音输入法安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Intelligent Pinyin拼音输入法安装\"></a>Intelligent Pinyin拼音输入法安装</h1><p>如果找不到Intelligent Pinyin输入源，可以使用如下命令安装。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>切换到管理员<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">su</span><br><span class=\"line\">输入密码</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>安装拼音文件<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum install -y ibus-libpinyin</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"第一步\"><a href=\"#第一步\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"第一步\"></a>第一步</h1><ul>\n<li>点击Application—&gt;System Tools—&gt;Settings，选择Region&amp;Language</li>\n<li><p>点击应用程序—&gt;系统工具—&gt;设置，选择Region&amp;Language<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/centos7.webp\"></p>\n</li>\n<li><p>点击 <code>&quot;+&quot;</code> 加号<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/add_pinyin.webp\"></p>\n</li>\n<li>切换输入法<br><img src=\"https://pic-bed-ahl.pages.dev/md_images/change.webp\"></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"Intelligent-Pinyin拼音输入法安装\"><a href=\"#Intelligent-Pinyin拼音输入法安装\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Intelligent Pinyin拼音输入法安装\"></a>Intelligent Pinyin拼音输入法安装</h1><p>如果找不到Intelligent Pinyin输入源，可以使用如下命令安装。</p>\n<ol>\n<li>切换到管理员<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">su</span><br><span class=\"line\">输入密码</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure></li>\n<li>安装拼音文件<figure class=\"highlight shell\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\">yum install -y ibus-libpinyin</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n</li>\n</ol>\n","categories":[{"name":"CentOS","path":"api/categories/CentOS.json"},{"name":"Linux","path":"api/categories/Linux.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"CentOS","path":"api/tags/CentOS.json"},{"name":"Linux","path":"api/tags/Linux.json"}]}